\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Wututuu w'akwan no 
\par Yudafo nkurow so,
\par na nhyira baa w'akwantu so.
\par Wob[y[[ w]n yiye,
\par kaa as[m kyer[[ w]n,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 \cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Woammu k]m ne suk]m
